1
00:00:00,188 --> 00:00:02,608
(Leonard:)Oh, God.

2
00:00:05,152 --> 00:00:07,652
(Leonard:)Sheldon does not have a cousin Leo.

3
00:00:07,821 --> 00:00:09,531
(Man:)Au contraire.

4
00:00:09,698 --> 00:00:10,988
(Man:)I'm 26 years old...

5
00:00:11,158 --> 00:00:16,498
...I'm originally from "Denton, Texas,"
but I was a Navy brat.

6
00:00:16,663 --> 00:00:19,663
(Man:)I was brought up on a variety
of military bases around the world.

7
00:00:19,833 --> 00:00:23,253
(Man:)As a result, I've often felt like an outsider,
never really fitting in...

8
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:25,880
(Man:)...probably the reason
for my substance-abuse problem.

9
00:00:26,048 --> 00:00:29,008
(Sheldon:)Excuse me, we just went over this.

10
00:00:29,176 --> 00:00:33,636
As the middle child, your addiction
is rooted in your unmet need for attention.

11
00:00:33,805 --> 00:00:36,555
Oh, Sheldon, are we really gonna go
with pop psychology?

12
00:00:36,725 --> 00:00:39,565
(Sheldon:)For your information,
this is all based on solid research.

13
00:00:39,728 --> 00:00:42,318
Just stick with the character profile
I wrote for you.

14
00:00:42,481 --> 00:00:44,061
- Sheldon?
- I'm sorry.

15
00:00:44,232 --> 00:00:45,812
(Sheldon:)Leonard, this is Toby Loobenfeld.

16
00:00:45,984 --> 00:00:48,694
(Sheldon:)He's a research assistant
in the particle-physics lab...

17
00:00:48,862 --> 00:00:52,032
...but he also minored in theater at MIT.

18
00:00:52,199 --> 00:00:54,029
(Toby:)It was more of a double major, actually.

19
00:00:54,409 --> 00:00:55,449
Theater and Physics.

20
00:00:55,619 --> 00:00:58,539
(Toby:)You can guess which one
my bourgeois parents pushed me towards.

21
00:00:58,705 --> 00:01:00,025
(Leonard:)Yeah, I got it.

